/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The XL journey that began with the vision of a few Jesuit fathers has nurtured many business leaders, industrialists, and changemakers as they translate dreams into reality. XLRI celebrated its Platinum Jubilee year from 11 October 2023 to 10 October 2024 at its Jamshedpur and Delhi-NCR Campuses. After all these years, when we look back, we are reminded of the undeterred pursuit of the founding fathers to bring change to society and the nation at large.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
