139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (XLRI launched a new program named PGDMIEV  at its Delhi-NCR Campus with the goal of empowering and encouraging students to pursue entrepreneurship and help the country by creating jobs rather than being job seekers. The inauguration ceremony took place on July 14, 2022, ushering in a new chapter in the history of XLRI. This year, we are welcoming the 4th Batch of PGDMIEV. We have successfully launched three batches of future leaders.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
