/S /P
/E (In addition to being an invaluable part of the corporate leadership in India and abroad, XLRI alums have also played a stellar role in the entrepreneurial ecosystem. Several XLRI alums have set up their own ventures and many have enjoyed tremendous growth and success. Some of the well-known startups set up by XLRI alums include unicons like Pharmeasy, Groww, Darwinbox and Mamaearth, XLRI alums have been part of several angel funds, Venture Capital Funds, Private Equity funds and Investment banks which have been active stakeholders in early-stage enterprises. They have also been contributors as mentors, coaches, consultants, and subject matter experts to early-stage ventures.)
