<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (XCEED was started by XLRI in 2019 as a sec 8 company with the purpose of developing an entrepreneurial ecosystem in XLRI and for entrepreneurship development activities in the ecosystem. XCEED operates out of both the clauses of XLRI, Jamshedpur, and Delhi-NCR. It provides flexible working space, meeting rooms and office infrastructure to incubatees. It helps students and incubatees connect with business service providers, tech services and financing institutions. Workshops and seminars are organized regularly to provide inputs to incubatees.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
