336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (XLRI is a bustling hub of academic excellence and vibrant extracurriculars. The blend of lectures, fests, sports, and a close-knit community defines its unique culture. Newcomers swiftly integrate into this close community, experiencing a mix of intense academics and enriching camaraderie.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The residential aspect fosters robust bonds between seniors and juniors, contributing to XLRI's extensive alum network among all Indian B-schools. Collaborative teamwork thrives here, evident in group projects, committees, and competitions, molding students into adept leaders and team players. Ethics and social responsibility are woven into XLRI's fabric, earning it esteem in the corporate world. The institute nurtures aspiring social entrepreneurs and champions ethical leadership. Industry visits and celebrations like Ganesh Chaturthi, Diwali, and Christmas enrich students' cultural experiences.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (PGDMIEV students are represented on all committees except those dealing with placements.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our In-house event Venture Sparx witnessed luminaries like Mr. Amit Jain, Shark and Founder- CarDekho, Mr. Ankur Warikoo,  Mr. Mahavir from TIE Delhi, Mr. Abhinav Chandan from Big Basket, Mr. Shantanu from Bombay Shaving Company, Ankit Prasad of Bobble AI, Aakash Anand of Bella Vita, Nitin Jain from OfBusiness, Ms. Shanti Mohan from LetsVenture, Mr. Abhishek Sinha from Eko India, and many more industry stalwarts. Their insights infused entrepreneurial vigor, inspiring students to pursue their visions. The institute also guides students who want to become social entrepreneurs. Life at XL is brimming with multiple experiences, from conferences, guest lectures, seminars, and workshops where a student is exposed to diverse views and opinions of the greatest minds in business to committee activities where a student learns management lessons beyond academics.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
